  "description": "Heightened levels of speed, comfort, and versatility make the Roadmachine 01 ONE an all-road bike engineered to excel wherever you ride. At its core is our ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame – the highest-grade layup we offer – providing uncompromising responsiveness, compliance and an ultra-low weight.\nRoom for bigger tires and deep in-frame compliance turn broken tarmac and light gravel into all-road territory. Shimano’s Dura-Ace drivetrain with 4iiii power meter brings pro-level efficiency to every climb and acceleration. Pair that with our 40 mm premium carbon wheels and proven ICS Carbon Evo cockpit, and you get total integration, zero compromises, and a ride that feels equally surgical and smooth.\nCables are hidden, storage is built-in, and your rear light is ready. The result? A bike that balances speed, precision and comfort.\nBecause in the end, it’s simple: the Roadmachine 01 ONE isn’t just any carbon road bike, it’s the bike.",
